{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the dark streets as a detective and uncover twisted mysteries!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are assigned as a detective in a city full of secrets. Each case awaits your investigation: question witnesses, gather clues, and piece together hidden connections. Every choice you make can change the outcome \u2014 will you catch the culprit, or will the secrets remain buried forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054820/extras/d39e7b3080c854f0f9e8582c1f9c5aba.avif?t=1761743334\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into an immersive detective experience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Solve multiple intriguing murder cases with branching storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc2 Examine clues: newspaper clippings, evidence files, phone messages, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Single-screen gameplay keeps you focused on the mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Test your observation, logic, and decision-making skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Every decision matters: the story reacts to your choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the free demo now and start your first case!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054820?t=1761743334","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054820?t=1761743334","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054820/bee64fc7165634862bbb36cc3d3a7b4fc92b2d63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=176174333